# bennu-arm64 with pybennu-power-solver replaced by ferrofire (ww-1df.9, ww-2z3; docs/provider-spec.md section 5b).
# One image: ferrofire speaks libzmq REP and RADIO UDP, so stock bennu field devices and bennu-probe talk to it.
# images/overlays/ferrofire/usr/local/bin/ferrofire = ferrofire's glibc aarch64 binary (ferrofire `make linux` -> dist/ferrofire), never committed.
# images/scripts/ferrofire-power.sh = ferrofire deploy/scripts/ferrofire-power.sh (symlink pybennu-power-solver -> ferrofire).
NAME=bennu-ferrofire-arm64
RELEASE=jammy
VARIANT=minbase
MIRROR=http://ports.ubuntu.com/ubuntu-ports
PACKAGES=""
SCRIPTS="bennu-arm64.sh ferrofire-power.sh"
OVERLAYS="bennu-arm64 ${SCEPTRE_PHENIX_IMAGES:-$HOME/git/sceptre-phenix-images}/overlays/bennu ${SCEPTRE_PHENIX_IMAGES:-$HOME/git/sceptre-phenix-images}/overlays/brash ferrofire"
SIZE=10G
MINGUI=0
